    "Copy Debug Info": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制调试信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include version info when you report a problem. Debug info also describes the network and the hosts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "报告问题时请附上版本信息。调试信息还会描述网络和主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Source": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open in Browser": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在浏览器中打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Code, fonts and themes that ship with Rex Go.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rex Go 附带的代码、字体和主题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copied": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已复制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About System": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · Full Catalog": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · 完整功能目录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld Features and Details": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 项功能与细节"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "861 Ghostty themes, each with a swatch, a filter of All, Dark and Light, and a search. A preview shows the chosen one in the terminal's font.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "861 款 Ghostty 主题，每款都有色板，可按全部、深色、浅色筛选，也能搜索。预览以终端字体展示所选主题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Ghostty terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ghostty 终端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bell gives a light tap, at most two a second.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "响铃时轻微震动，每秒最多两次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A drag follows the finger, a flick coasts and slows, and the ends bounce. Full-screen programs and those that use the mouse get the scroll as wheel events.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动跟手，轻扫后惯性减速，到头会回弹。全屏程序和使用鼠标的程序收到的是滚轮事件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A font with Chinese and Nerd Font glyphs, to download. Only its four faces download, about 40 MB; stop it or delete it at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一款含中文和 Nerd Font 图标的可下载字体。只下载四种字形，约 40 MB，可随时停止或删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A half-height photo picker": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "半屏照片选择器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A key bar that stays": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "常驻的按键栏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A label for this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本设备的标签"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A line of progress": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "进度条"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A long press selects the word under the finger, with the loupe. Drag to select more; past the top or bottom the terminal scrolls on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "长按选中手指下的单词，并显示放大镜。拖动可扩大选区，拖到顶部或底部时终端会继续滚动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification opens its terminal. The terminal on screen sends none.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点通知会打开对应的终端。正在查看的终端不会发通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A program that uses the mouse gets a tap as a click, and the keyboard stays up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用鼠标的程序会把轻点当作点击，键盘保持弹出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A program's progress (OSC 9;4) shows as a thin line at the top, red on an error.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序报告的进度（OSC 9;4）显示为顶部的一条细线，出错时变红。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A terminal opens in the background last seen on its host, so it does not flash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端以该主机上次的背景色打开，不会闪烁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activity under the eye": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "眼睛图标下的动态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An arrow stick": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "方向摇杆"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appearance": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外观"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back from the background, the terminal connects again and every title stays. A dropped connection tries again by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从后台返回时终端自动重连，所有标题都保留。连接中断时会自动重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back where you left it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回来时一切如旧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Backspace on the key bar repeats while held, as the keyboard's does.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住按键栏上的退格会连续删除，与系统键盘一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bells": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "响铃"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chinese and other input methods": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中文等输入法"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click and drag to select as with a mouse, scroll with two fingers, and rows highlight under the pointer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "像鼠标一样点按拖动来选择，双指滚动，指针悬停的行会高亮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dictate into the terminal. A correction erases what was dictated and types it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以直接对终端听写。修正听写内容时会删掉原文并重新输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dictation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "听写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag the stick for arrows, which repeat while you hold it. The modifiers hold with it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动摇杆发送方向键，按住不放会连发。修饰键在此期间保持按下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each step is one point with a light tap, and the grid's columns and rows show for a moment. The size stays for every terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一级 1 pt，伴随轻微震动，并短暂显示行列数。字号对所有终端生效并保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edge to edge": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全屏铺满"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit the list to delete or reorder hosts, and ⓘ for a host's details.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑列表可删除或重新排序主机，轻点 ⓘ 查看主机详情。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a server's address, its name, and its icon.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入服务器地址、名称，并选择图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every key on the bar gives a light tap as you press it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按下按键栏上的每个键都有轻微震动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Features": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "功能与细节"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files & Photos": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件与照片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files from the Files app go to the host the same way, and their paths are pasted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“文件”App 中的文件以同样方式上传到主机，并粘贴路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fonts and sizes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字体与字号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hardware keyboards": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外接键盘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold Backspace to repeat": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住退格连续删除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the spacebar and slide to move the cursor, one arrow for each cell.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住空格键滑动即可移动光标，每经过一格发送一个方向键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home & Hosts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首页与主机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hosts & Pairing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机与配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JetBrains Mono, SF Mono, Menlo or Courier New, from 8 to 24 points.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JetBrains Mono、SF Mono、Menlo 或 Courier New，字号 8 至 24 pt。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the colors of the host's terminal in place of a theme.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沿用主机终端的配色，而不使用主题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyboard & Input": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键盘与输入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keys in the shortcuts bar": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按键位于快捷键栏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keys that tap back": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按键震动反馈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Liquid Glass": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "液态玻璃"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Long-press to select": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "长按选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maple Mono NF CN": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maple Mono NF CN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Modifiers for the next key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修饰键作用于下一个键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move the cursor with the spacebar": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用空格键移动光标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name this device in Settings. Hosts see the label when it connects.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在设置里为本设备命名，连接时主机会看到这个标签。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On iPad and in wide windows, the list stays beside the terminal that is open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPad 和宽窗口中，列表始终显示在打开的终端旁边。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open source": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens in its own colors": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以自己的颜色打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Option is Alt, chords with Control, Shift or Option reach the program, and held keys repeat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Option 作为 Alt，Control、Shift、Option 组合键都能传给程序，按住的键会连发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair by QR code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫码配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste from the ⌘ menu on the key bar, from the selection's menu, or with ⌘V.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可从按键栏的 ⌘ 菜单、选区菜单粘贴，或按 ⌘V。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pasted paths are quoted for the shell and end with a space. A name the shell cannot take is not pasted, and an alert says why.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粘贴的路径已按 shell 规则加引号，并以空格结尾。shell 无法接受的文件名不会粘贴，并会提示原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paths ready for the shell": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直接可用的路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Photos go to the host's temporary folder as their original files, and their paths are pasted into the terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片以原始文件上传到主机的临时文件夹，并把路径粘贴到终端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pinch to size the text": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "双指捏合调整字号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pinyin and other input methods compose at the cursor, with their candidates beside it, and send the text once it is done.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拼音等输入法在光标处显示输入中的文字，候选词就在旁边，选定后一次性发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pointer and trackpad": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指针与触控板"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Programs copy to the clipboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序可复制到剪贴板"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Programs' notifications": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序发出的通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Programs such as Neovim and tmux copy to the clipboard with OSC 52, from the terminal on screen only. They cannot read it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neovim、tmux 等程序可用 OSC 52 复制到剪贴板，仅限屏幕上的终端。程序无法读取剪贴板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rex Go puts the terminals of your computers on your iPhone and iPad: a Ghostty terminal with a key bar, selection, scrolling and input made for touch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rex Go 把你电脑上的终端带到 iPhone 和 iPad：基于 Ghostty 的终端，按键栏、选择、滚动和输入都为触控而设计。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan the Rex QR code that GoRex or Rex shows to add a host. A host you have already opens instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描 GoRex 或 Rex 显示的 Rex 二维码即可添加主机。已添加的主机会直接打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scroll with the system's physics": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统原生的滚动手感"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Search Features and Details": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "搜索功能与细节"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select over the mouse": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序占用鼠标时也能选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Selection & Links": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择与链接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Selection handles": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选区手柄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Selection works while a program uses the mouse, and the program does not get those touches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序使用鼠标时依然可以选择文字，这些触摸不会传给程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up a host by hand": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手动添加主机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings & About": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置与关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System, Dark or Light": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随系统、深色或浅色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Control, Option or Shift, then a key, for a chord. They let go after that key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先点 Control、Option 或 Shift，再按一个键即可组合。按完后修饰键自动松开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a link to open it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点打开链接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to click": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点即点击"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to open the terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点通知打开终端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The command new terminals on a host run in place of its login shell.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该主机上新终端运行的命令，用来代替登录 shell。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The interface follows the system, or stays dark or light.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "界面可跟随系统，也可固定为深色或浅色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key bar's keys and four repeating arrows go in the keyboard's shortcuts bar, which shows with a hardware keyboard too and gives a Magic Keyboard its Esc.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按键栏的按键和四个可连发的方向键放在键盘的快捷键栏里，接外接键盘时也会显示，让妙控键盘也有 Esc。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The keyboard slides the terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键盘推起终端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The licenses of the code, fonts and themes the app ships, and its source on GitHub.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 自带的代码、字体和主题的许可，以及 GitHub 上的源代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list beside the terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列表与终端并排"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list, the buttons, the sheets and the key bar use the system's Liquid Glass.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列表、按钮、弹出面板和按键栏都采用系统的液态玻璃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photo picker opens at half the screen, with the terminal above it. Pull it up for the full screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片选择器以半屏打开，上方仍能看到终端。向上拉即可全屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The search at the bottom of Settings filters its rows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置底部的搜索可筛选设置项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The terminal does not resize as the keyboard comes and goes. It slides up only as far as the cursor and the lines under it need.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键盘弹出或收起时终端不改变尺寸，只上移到刚好露出光标及其下方的行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The terminal's background fills the screen. Text under the status bar blurs and fades, so the clock stays legible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端背景铺满整个屏幕。状态栏下的文字会模糊淡出，时间依然清晰可读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The title opens the session": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点标题打开会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The version, the device, iOS and each host's Rex version. Settings › Developer copies version or debug info for a problem report.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示版本、设备、iOS 版本和每台主机的 Rex 版本。在「设置 › 开发者」里可复制版本或调试信息用于问题报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Themes with a preview": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "带预览的主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three glass capsules: ⌘, a row of keys, and an arrow stick, the mic and the key that hides or shows the keyboard. The bar stays at the bottom while the keyboard is hidden.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三个玻璃胶囊：⌘、一排按键，以及方向摇杆、麦克风和收起或显示键盘的键。键盘收起时，按键栏留在屏幕底部。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two handles move the ends of the selection, and a menu has Copy, Paste and Select All.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两个手柄调整选区的两端，菜单里有拷贝、粘贴和全选。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three pages of keys": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三页按键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upload progress": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上传进度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Web and mail links in the output open with a tap, as do links a program marks with OSC 8. A link followed by Chinese ends where its address does.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输出中的网页和邮件链接轻点即可打开，程序用 OSC 8 标记的链接也一样。链接后紧跟中文时，链接在地址结束处截止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you type is sent when the connection is back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接恢复后会发送你输入的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a program needs input": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序需要输入时提醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an agent such as Claude Code waits for you, a notification says so, while the app is open or soon after you leave it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 等代理在等你操作时会发来通知，App 在前台或刚切到后台时都有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPad": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can't read this folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你无权读取这个文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘ on the key bar spins while files go up, and an alert tells of an upload that failed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上传文件时按键栏上的 ⌘ 会转圈，上传失败会弹窗提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘ shortcuts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘ 快捷键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4.5 (WCAG AA)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4.5（WCAG AA）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "7 (WCAG AAA)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "7（WCAG AAA）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Minimum Contrast": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最低对比度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off (Default)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭（默认）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turns text too close to its background black or white, colors programs set too, so it reads; its color is lost, so errors and warnings may look alike. Box drawing keeps its colors. Off shows programs' colors as they are.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把与背景太接近的文字换成黑色或白色，包括程序设置的颜色，以便阅读；原来的颜色会丢失，错误、警告等可能看起来一样。框线字符保持原色。关闭后按程序的颜色原样显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale is not running": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale 未运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server refused this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器拒绝了此设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refused: sign Rex Go in as the Tailscale user who signed in the GoRex machine, not with a tagged key, or turn on --allow-tailnet-members there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "被拒绝：请用登录 GoRex 电脑的同一 Tailscale 用户登录 Rex Go，不要用带标签的密钥；或在那台电脑上开启 --allow-tailnet-members。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Built-in Tailscale": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内置 Tailscale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rex Go joins your tailnet itself, with no Tailscale app or VPN. Hosts on the tailnet go through it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rex Go 自己加入你的 tailnet，无需 Tailscale App 或 VPN。tailnet 上的主机经由它连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Status": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GoRex Machines": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GoRex 电脑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign In": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign Out": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出登录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auth Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "认证密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in as the Tailscale user who signed in your GoRex machine. An auth key is used once and not kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请用登录 GoRex 电脑的同一 Tailscale 用户登录。认证密钥只用一次，不会保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Device Name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Control Server": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制服务器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A device name has letters, digits and hyphens, not at either end.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备名称只能包含字母、数字和连字符，且连字符不能在首尾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A control server's URL starts with https://, or http:// for a local address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制服务器的 URL 须以 https:// 开头；本地地址可用 http://。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave the control server empty for Tailscale's own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制服务器留空即使用 Tailscale 官方服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Direct": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直连"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DERP Relay": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DERP 中继"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Peer Relay": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "节点中继"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Idle": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空闲"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reach this host through Rex Go's own Tailscale, not the phone's network or the Tailscale app. With built-in Tailscale off, it goes the phone's way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "经由 Rex Go 自带的 Tailscale 连接此主机，而不是手机网络或 Tailscale App。内置 Tailscale 关闭时，按手机的方式连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new name applies at the next start: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新名称将在下次启动时生效：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale 已关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale couldn't start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale 无法启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale 已连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale needs sign-in": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale 需要登录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale waiting for approval": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale 正在等待批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale connecting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale 连接中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailscale inside Rex Go, no VPN": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale 在 Rex Go 内运行，无 VPN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On · Rex Go Only": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启 · 仅 Rex Go"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign out of Tailscale?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要退出登录 Tailscale 吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Online": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Globe": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地球"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Server": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cloud": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "云"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rex Go's connection to GoRex is not ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rex Go 与 GoRex 的连接尚未就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This phone's key for GoRex's remote access: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机用于 GoRex 远程访问的密钥：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GoRex remote access": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GoRex 远程访问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paired by GoRex's Rex Go code. Deleting the host here doesn't revoke this phone: remove it from Devices in GoRex's Settings › Server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 GoRex 的 Rex Go 二维码配对。在这里删除主机不会撤销本机的授权：请在 GoRex 的 设置 › 服务器 › 设备 中移除它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair with %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与 %@ 配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paired. Rex Go is connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已配对，Rex Go 已连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On %@, approve %@ in Settings › Server › Devices only if its fingerprint is this one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在 %1$@ 的 设置 › 服务器 › 设备 中，仅当指纹与此一致时批准 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asking %@ to pair…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在请求与 %@ 配对…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't pair: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法配对：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not connected yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rex Go keeps trying: approve this phone on the machine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rex Go 会继续尝试：请在那台电脑上批准本机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair with GoRex": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与 GoRex 配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a GoRex machine with Reachable at on: first choose Pair New Device… in its Settings › Server › Devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于开启了“可达地址”的 GoRex 电脑：请先在它的 设置 › 服务器 › 设备 中选择“配对新设备…”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare this code with the one %@ shows. Both must be the same.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请将此代码与 %@ 上显示的代码对比，两者必须一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On %@, open Settings › Server › Devices and approve the request showing this code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在 %@ 上打开 设置 › 服务器 › 设备，批准显示此代码的请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The codes match": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代码一致"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They differ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代码不同"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pairing didn't match.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对不一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The machine may have let in an unknown device: remove its newest device in its Settings › Server › Devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "那台电脑可能放进了一台未知设备：请在它的 设置 › 服务器 › 设备 中移除最新的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnostics": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "诊断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Failure": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "失败原因"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Host": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tailnet Path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailnet 路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ping": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ping"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a machine to test the connection to it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点一台电脑，测试与它的连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A terminal that can't connect offers Diagnostics: where it stopped, the path to the host, pings of three sizes and the recent log, to copy into a report. A GoRex machine in Settings › Tailscale opens the same.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连不上的终端提供“诊断”：卡在哪一步、到主机的路径、三种大小的 ping 和最近的日志，可复制到问题报告里。在“设置 › Tailscale”中轻点一台 GoRex 电脑也能打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't Record": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法录音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't Recognise Speech": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
