      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "听写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to speak, and again to type what you said.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点开始说话，再点一下把你说的话打进终端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download the Speech Model?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载语音模型？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Speech is recognised on this device, by %@. Its model, %@, downloads once from Hugging Face, or from hf-mirror.com, a mirror run by others, where Hugging Face can't be reached. Delete it in Settings › Terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音由 %1$@ 在本机上识别。它的模型（%2$@）只需下载一次，来自 Hugging Face；连不上 Hugging Face 时改从 hf-mirror.com 下载，那是第三方运营的镜像。可在“设置 › 终端”中删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't Download the Speech Model": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法下载语音模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dictate with the mic": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用麦克风听写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the mic on the key bar, or at the top right of the terminal on iPad or with a hardware keyboard, and speak; tap it again, and what you said is typed at the cursor, not sent. Speech is recognised on this device by SenseVoice, in Chinese, English, Cantonese, Japanese or Korean, with punctuation. Its model, about 240 MB, downloads on the first tap; choose a larger one, or delete it, in Settings › Terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点按键栏上的麦克风（在 iPad 上或连接硬件键盘时，在终端右上角）并说话；再点一下，你说的话就打在光标处，但不发送。语音由 SenseVoice 在本机上识别，支持中文、英语、粤语、日语和韩语，带标点。它的模型约 240 MB，首次轻点时下载；可在“设置 › 终端”中换用更大的模型，或删除它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyboard Input": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键盘输入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
