          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "固定的 Agent CLI 会显示在此项目的快捷启动栏中。全部关闭则恢复显示「新建标签页」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quick Launchers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快捷启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quick Launchers…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快捷启动…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show All Installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示全部已安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Tab, Rename, Color, Move to Space and Close Project, which asks first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新建标签页、重命名、颜色、移到空间和关闭项目；关闭项目前会先确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Project": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Tab Open": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未打开标签页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications that programs send with OSC 9 or OSC 777 show as the system's, grouped by tab.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序用 OSC 9 或 OSC 777 发出的通知以系统通知显示，并按标签页分组。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Older": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更早"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the name changes: the folder and the tabs stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只改名称，文件夹和标签页保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Projects under each host": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每台主机下的项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rename": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重命名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rename Host": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重命名主机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rename Space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重命名空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rename Tab": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重命名标签页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rename Tab, Reset Name, Move Up, Move Down, Move to Project, New Tab and Close Tab.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重命名标签页、重置名称、上移、下移、移到项目、新建标签页和关闭标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rename Tab…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重命名标签页…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rename…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重命名…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Search tabs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "搜索标签页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show All Tabs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示所有标签页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show in %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「%@」中显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spaces": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The + by a host browses its folders and makes a project of one. New Tab in a project opens on its host, in its folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机旁的 + 浏览它的文件夹，用其中一个新建项目。项目里的新标签页在它的主机上、它的文件夹中打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The eye lists the tabs of every host by what their programs need: waiting for input first, then failed, done and working, with how long ago.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "眼睛图标按程序的状态列出所有主机的标签页：等待输入的在前，然后是失败、完成和运行中，并显示距今多久。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name shows on this device only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个名称只在本设备上显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The picker at the top shows one space at a time, such as Work or Life. Tap it to see every space with its projects: New Space adds one, and Edit renames, colors and orders them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顶部的选择器一次显示一个空间，例如「工作」或「生活」。点按它可查看每个空间及其项目：「新建空间」添加空间，「编辑」重命名空间、设颜色和排序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The project's tabs open on %@, in this folder. A folder is one project: if it is one already, that project shows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目的标签页在 %@ 上的这个文件夹中打开。一个文件夹只对应一个项目：它已是项目时，显示那个项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The search at the bottom filters the tabs by title, in the list and under the eye.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "底部的搜索按标题筛选标签页，列表和动态视图都适用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The space stays here, empty, until a project moves into it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个空间会留在这里，保持为空，直到有项目移入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tab closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标签页已关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The title shows the tab's program and title. Tap it for the session's tabs, New Tab and Switch Session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标题显示标签页的程序和标题。轻点可查看会话的标签页、新建标签页和切换会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're in demo mode. Add a host to run your own tabs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你正在演示模式中。添加主机后即可运行你自己的标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A space is the name on its projects. Renaming one renames it on every host; deleting one moves its projects to Default. A host that is offline takes the change when it connects.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空间是项目上的名称。重命名空间会在每台主机上生效；删除空间会把它的项目移到“默认”。离线的主机在连上后执行更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete space %@?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除空间“%@”？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its %lld projects move to Default. No tab closes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Its %lld project moves to Default. No tab closes."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Its %lld projects move to Default. No tab closes."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "它的 %lld 个项目将移到“默认”。不会关闭任何标签页。"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Collapse Developer Mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收起开发者模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Developer Mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开发者模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No connection events yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂无连接事件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows a floating connection bar over the app with live host status, network path, and recent connection events.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在应用顶部显示悬浮连接条，实时查看主机状态、网络路径和最近的连接事件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Developer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开发者"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Problem Report": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "问题报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Photo": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择照片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No QR code in this photo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这张照片里没有二维码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No listening ports": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有监听的端口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A program in this pane is not listening on a TCP port.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个分屏中的程序没有在监听 TCP 端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't load ports": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "端口列表加载失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查连接后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't reach the host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连不上主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't pair.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No hosts yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有主机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No windows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No matching themes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有匹配的主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No devices admitted yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有已允许的设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't download the web client.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网页客户端下载失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe the middle capsule from Esc, Control, Option and Enter to Shift, / - and Backspace, then to ~, | and Tab.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左右滑动中间的胶囊，在 Esc、Control、Option、Enter，Shift、/ - 和退格，以及 ~、| 和 Tab 三页之间切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘T opens a tab, ⌘W closes it, ⌘O adds a file, ⇧⌘O a photo, ⇧⌘I the composer, ⌘K clears the screen and scrollback, and ⌘+, ⌘- and ⌘0 size the text. Hold ⌘ to see them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘T 新建标签页，⌘W 关闭，⌘O 添加文件，⇧⌘O 添加照片，⇧⌘I 打开撰写，⌘K 清除屏幕和回滚，⌘+、⌘- 和 ⌘0 调整字号。按住 ⌘ 可查看全部。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Composer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "撰写器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Composer Mode": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Composer Mode"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Composer 模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pins the compose bar above the key bar and moves the mic into it, so typing and dictation land in the message field for you to read before Send. It takes effect on a terminal opened after the change.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pins the compose bar above the key bar and moves the mic into it, so typing and dictation land in the message field for you to read before Send. It takes effect on a terminal opened after the change."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把 compose 栏固定在键栏上方，并把麦克风移入其中：输入与听写都先进入消息字段，供你在 Send 前查看。该改动对之后打开的终端生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compose": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "撰写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Message": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "消息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Photo": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Camera": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove Attachment": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除附件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe up on the key bar, tap the Compose key by ⌘, or press ⇧⌘I for a message bar over it: write lines, attach photos, camera shots and files, and Send puts their paths and the text into the terminal as one prompt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在键栏上滑、点 ⌘ 旁的撰写键或按 ⇧⌘I，打开键栏上方的消息条：可写多行并附加照片、拍照和文件，发送会把路径和文字一起放进终端，作为一条提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Message to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "给 %@ 发消息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Attachment": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加附件"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
